-- riftboundop.com/rq-los-angeles-prize-wall. Adds those 3 events to the Plated Legends, double-sized battlefields and
-- Regional Rune Collection already on the tracker, and adds the Crystal Rose prize wall playmats and the 3 event pins.
-- Safe to run more than once.

